WEBVTT

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:01.690
We want our students to engage
while they are in their education

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:04.580
with research problems, 
research challenges,

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.504
that it is really an actual real-life 
type of a challenge for them,

00:17:08.504 --> 00:17:13.123
and not only, if you would like,
hypothetical problems.

00:17:13.123 --> 00:17:16.874
We want them to really be addressing
an actual challenge.

00:17:17.124 --> 00:17:20.004
The third element, 
which I think is also key,

00:17:20.004 --> 00:17:23.134
it is related to innovation 
and entrepreneurship.

00:17:23.134 --> 00:17:27.724
We want the students to relate 
to be entrepreneurs.

00:17:28.774 --> 00:17:30.694
We want the faculty to be entrepreneurs,